<div class="sanction-flow-help">
    <button
        class="sanction-flow-help__trigger"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Ver guía de tipos y estados de sanciones"
        aria-describedby="sanction-flow-help-popover"
    >
        <i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <section class="sanction-flow-help__popover" id="sanction-flow-help-popover" role="tooltip" aria-label="Guía de sanciones">
        <header class="sanction-flow-help__header">
            <span class="sanction-flow-help__header-icon"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <div>
                <h2>Guía rápida de sanciones</h2>
                <p>Tipos disponibles y recorrido de sus estados</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="sanction-flow-help__section">
            <h3><i class="bi bi-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tipos de sanción</h3>
            <ul class="sanction-flow-help__types">
                <% (Array.isArray(locals.SANCTION_TYPES) ? locals.SANCTION_TYPES : []).forEach(function (tipo) { %>
                    <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><%= tipo %></span></li>
                <% }) %>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="sanction-flow-help__section">
            <h3><i class="bi bi-signpost-split" aria-hidden="true"></i> Estados y transiciones</h3>
            <ul class="sanction-flow-help__states">
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--pending">Pendiente</span><span>Registro anterior que espera activación.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--active">ACTIVA</span><span>Sanción vigente.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--postponed">APLAZADA</span><span>Sanción en pausa temporal.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--closing">POR SALDAR</span><span>Registro anterior pendiente de cierre.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--settled">SALDADA</span><span>Sanción finalizada.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <ol class="sanction-flow-help__transitions">
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--pending">Pendiente</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--active">ACTIVA</span><span>El laboratorista activa registros pendientes desde el listado.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--active">ACTIVA</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--settled">SALDADA</span><span>El laboratorista puede finalizarla directamente.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--active">ACTIVA</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--postponed">APLAZADA</span><span>Puede aplazarse y reactivarse según los permisos configurados.</span></li>
                <li><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--closing">POR SALDAR</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sanction-flow-help__state sanction-flow-help__state--settled">SALDADA</span><span>El laboratorista puede cerrar estos registros desde el listado.</span></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="sanction-flow-help__note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Los registros nuevos se crean directamente como <strong>ACTIVA</strong>; Pendiente y POR SALDAR pueden corresponder a registros anteriores.</p>
        </section>
    </section>
</div>
